Package: R2D2
Title: Bayesian Linear Regression Using the R2-D2 Shrinkage Prior
Version: 1.0.0.9000
Description: Fits Bayesian linear regression with global and local shrinkage
    under the R2-D2 prior. This modified version adds optional sign constraints
    to the Dirichlet-Laplace and marginal R2-D2 samplers.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
